]}], "type": "WSB", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 11, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Employees are the most important part of any business and finding the right ones can be a challenge. In order to ensure that you have a professional and qualified staff, you have got to establish some effective hiring practices before you begin your recruitment search. If you are able to take a longer view of the hiring process, you will find talented and experienced employees to provide good customer service and help maintain the long-term profitability of your business.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "A first step is to look at your recruitment sources to determine which employment agencies have recommended qualified, effective employees. You should also evaluate whether any nearby colleges or online job search websites have resulted in the hiring of quality employees. You must track the performance of all your recruitment sources and utilize only the best ones to look for employees for your restaurant.", "id": 2, "time": "33000", "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "If you hire someone with restaurant experience, they will be familiar with the processes and skills needed for the job and understand the flexibility needed in scheduling. If you receive an application from someone who has worked in several capacities, from host to server to kitchen staff, you have to consider that applicant seriously. When you find yourself short-staffed, an employee who can fill in where needed will be an invaluable addition to your team.", "id": 3, "time": "60250", "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "Your current staff can also recommend people for available restaurant positions. If you hire someone recommended by a current staff member, you will also get a lot of help with training. A friend will likely want to help a new employee learn the ropes.\n<br>You must seek out new employees that will fit into the culture and dynamic of your restaurant. You should come up with interview questions that evaluate the interviewee's attitude toward teamwork.", "id": 4, "time": "92100", "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img03.jpg"}, {"text": "Before you start to interview candidates, you have got to list which skills you require your employees to have, for example, problem-solving skills and diplomacy, efficiency, organization and prioritization skills, and the ability to work well under pressure. If you can ask interview questions that allow the candidate to show you their skills, you will have a clear idea of the contribution that person will be able to make to your restaurant.", "id": 5, "time": "121000", "image": "engenn11le05ob07re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le05ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le05ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}